  "body": [
    "Home",
    "Is your Adobe investment delivering?",
    "You've invested in Adobe. Now make it work harder. Valtech helps enterprises connect content workflows, automate manual effort and apply AI to create targeted, on-brand content at scale.",
    "Many enterprises have invested heavily in Adobe but still face slow production cycles, fragmented workflows and inconsistent execution. The tools are there. The results aren't keeping up.",
    "Our demo shows how to close that gap. Learn how to orchestrate the full content journey from intake to publishing, combining Adobe technology with Valtech Content OS generative studio accelerator.",
    "Global brands face relentless pressure: more content, more channels, more relevance — but with less complexity.",
    "We help marketing, creative, operations and IT teams streamline how content gets planned, produced, approved, reused and delivered.",
    "Connect the workflows. Apply AI where it creates real value.",
    "Teams move faster, reduce manual effort and deliver stronger content across every touchpoint.",
    "Align teams, workflows and AI-powered creation through one connected process from intake to publishing.",
    "Our demo will show you how business-critical content workflows move from intake to publishing through one connected process.",
    "You'll see how Adobe and Valtech's Valtech Content OS generative studio accelerator work together to support AI-powered copy and image creation, validate outputs against brand guidelines and automate key governance steps. Work that once took weeks now moves in a matter of clicks.",
    "Schedule a demo walkthrough",
    "This is designed for organizations managing large volumes of content across brands, markets, channels and teams — especially if you've invested in Adobe but aren't yet seeing the speed, efficiency, consistency or scale your business needs.",
    "Connected content operations mean faster campaign launches and stronger performance",
    "Less chaos, fewer handoffs and more reuse",
    "A more secure, scalable foundation for AI-powered creativity",
    "efficiency gains in content production workflows",
    "direct annual cost savings",
    "faster campaign launches",
    "lower third-party agency spend",
    "Schedule a walkthrough to see how connected workflows, automation and AI help your teams create better content, faster.",
    "Schedule a demo walkthrough",
    "Valtech's most senior Adobe voice and the architect of our GEO QuickStart offering. Iva leads our global Adobe partnership and brings both strategic credibility and hands-on platform expertise."
  ],
